{% comment %}
  Raqi — Discovery Box, 3-step sequential picker (Raqi box design system).

  2026-09-02 CATALOGUE CAP FIX (this revision). Two separate 50-product
  truncation bugs are fixed here, both caused by iterating
  collections['all'].products outside a {% paginate %} block, where Shopify
  hard-caps the loop at 50 items and drops the remainder SILENTLY — no
  error, no warning, nothing in the admin.

  BUG 1 (picker grids): the Signature and Discovery grids each looped the
  full catalogue and filtered by tag. At 41 published products this had not
  bitten yet, but activating the 6 remaining drafts takes the store to 47 —
  three products from the cliff. Past 50, fragrances would vanish from the
  picker with no signal. Fixed by wrapping BOTH panels in a single
  {% paginate ... by 250 %} block, raising the ceiling 50 -> 250.

  Why ONE paginate block and not two: {% paginate %} binds to the ?page=
  URL parameter. Two blocks on the same page fight over the same parameter
  and produce incoherent paging. One block bounds the collection for every
  loop nested inside it.

  Why not `limit:`: {% for product in collection.products limit: 250 %}
  does NOT work. The 50-item cap is imposed by Shopify on
  collection.products outside paginate and cannot be raised with `limit`.
  {% paginate %} is the only supported mechanism.

  BUG 2 (box product lookup, more severe): box_product was resolved by
  looping the same capped 50-product array looking for a handle match. If
  the box product ever fell outside the first 50, box_product would be
  null, box_variant_id would render empty, and the Add to Bag button would
  fail for EVERY customer with the generic error message — a total
  checkout failure for this page, triggered by nothing more than adding
  unrelated products to the catalogue. Fixed by using Shopify's global
  all_products[handle] object, which is a direct handle lookup with no
  catalogue-size dependency at all.

  NOTE: the local variable formerly named `all_products` was shadowing that
  global object, which is why the original code had to loop in the first
  place. The local assign is now removed entirely, so the global resolves.
  Shopify permits up to 20 distinct handle lookups per page via
  all_products; this uses exactly one.

  NEW: silent truncation is now impossible. A guard reads paginate.pages
  (paginate's own metadata, so it is always accurate) and, if the catalogue
  ever exceeds 250, renders a red banner in the theme editor and logs a
  console error on the live storefront. Failure is loud from now on.

  ---- Previous revision notes, unchanged ----

  2026-08-16 i18n pass: replaced every hardcoded English string (previously
  section.settings.xxx | default: 'English text') with real translation
  keys under raqi.discovery_box.* in locales/en.default.json and
  locales/ar.json, so the flow actually renders in Arabic on /ar-ae
  instead of silently falling back to English. Root cause of the bug this
  fixes: the section was originally built with settings-based text only,
  and Shopify section settings are NOT locale-aware — they render the
  same value regardless of active language. Reused the sitewide
  raqi.product.note_top/note_heart/note_base keys for the notes modal
  instead of creating duplicates.

  IMPORTANT constraint discovered during this fix: Shopify caps locale
  files at 3,400 total translation entries. locales/ar.json was already
  at 3,377 (mostly bulk-translated Shopify default checkout/account
  strings unrelated to this theme) — only 23 keys of headroom. The
  discovery_box key set below was deliberately trimmed to 20 keys to fit
  (merged step_label_prefix+step_label_of into one "Step {n} of 3"
  template, reused notes_trigger_label for both the button text and its
  aria-label instead of a separate _aria key, merged the two error
  strings into one error_message, and dropped the empty-state notes
  message). File is now at 3,397/3,400 — 3 keys of headroom left
  sitewide. Flagged to the merchant as a structural constraint worth a
  dedicated cleanup pass later; not addressed here.

  NOTE on {n}/{count} placeholders: Shopify's Liquid tag lexer rejects a
  literal '{' or '}' character typed directly inside a {{ }} output tag
  (even inside a quoted string argument), so the placeholder token is
  built at runtime from an assigned '{' / '}' character pair inside a
  {% liquid %} block instead of being typed literally inside {{ }}.

  2026-08-16 RTL CSS fix: the notes-modal label (Top/Heart/Base) used a
  physical margin-right for spacing, which collapses to zero visual gap
  in RTL/Arabic because the following text flows to the same side the
  margin was pushing away from. Switched to the logical margin-inline-end
  property so the gap is correct in both LTR and RTL automatically.

  Everything else (3-step flow logic, 15ml labels, no per-item prices,
  fixed box total, single bundle cart line with fragrance line-item
  properties, notes popover) is unchanged from the prior revision.
{% endcomment %}
{{ 'component-product-bundles.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- liquid
  comment
    Box product resolved by direct handle lookup against Shopify's global
    all_products object. No catalogue loop, so no 50-item cap exposure.
  endcomment
  assign box_handle = section.settings.box_product_handle | default: 'raqi-discovery-box'
  assign box_product = all_products[box_handle]

  assign box_variant_id = ''
  assign box_price_display = section.settings.box_price | default: 'Dhs. 599.00'
  assign box_was_display = ''
  if box_product
    assign box_variant = box_product.variants.first
    assign box_variant_id = box_variant.id
    assign box_price_display = box_variant.price | money
    # 2026-09-05: the struck price is read from the variant's compare_at_price,
    # never typed as copy, so this total and the homepage price card share one
    # source and cannot drift apart. Clear compare-at on the product and both
    # quietly return to a single price with no code change.
    if box_variant.compare_at_price > box_variant.price
      assign box_was_display = box_variant.compare_at_price | money
    endif
  endif

  assign ob = '{'
  assign cb = '}'
  assign n_token = ob | append: 'n' | append: cb
  assign count_token = ob | append: 'count' | append: cb
  assign step_label_template = 'raqi.discovery_box.step_label' | t
  assign step_label_1 = step_label_template | replace: n_token, '1'
  assign step2_hint_template = 'raqi.discovery_box.step_2_hint' | t
  assign step2_hint_0 = step2_hint_template | replace: count_token, '0'
-%}
<section class="raqi-db raqi-section" id="raqi-discovery-box" data-raqi-db data-box-variant-id="{{ box_variant_id }}">
  <div class="raqi-container raqi-db__container">
    <div class="raqi-db__intro">
      <p class="raqi-micro-label raqi-micro-label--accent">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
      <h1 class="raqi-db__heading">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.heading' | t }}</h1>
      <p class="raqi-db__subhead">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.subhead' | t }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="raqi-db__progress">
      <p class="raqi-db__step-label" id="RaqiDbStepLabel">{{ step_label_1 }}</p>
      <div class="raqi-db__bar"><div class="raqi-db__bar-fill" id="RaqiDbBarFill" style="width:33%"></div></div>
      <div class="raqi-db__dots">
        <button type="button" class="raqi-db__dot is-active" data-db-dot="1">
          <span class="raqi-db__dot-num">1</span><span class="raqi-db__dot-label">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_1_name' | t }}</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="raqi-db__dot" data-db-dot="2" disabled>
          <span class="raqi-db__dot-num">2</span><span class="raqi-db__dot-label">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_2_name' | t }}</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="raqi-db__dot" data-db-dot="3" disabled>
          <span class="raqi-db__dot-num">3</span><span class="raqi-db__dot-label">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_3_name' | t }}</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="raqi-db__summary-bar" id="RaqiDbSummaryBar" hidden>
      <span class="raqi-db__summary-text" id="RaqiDbSummaryText"></span>
      <button type="button" class="raqi-db__change-link" id="RaqiDbChangeSignature">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.change_label' | t }}</button>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      ONE paginate block wrapping BOTH picker grids. Raises the per-loop
      product ceiling from 50 to 250. Do not split this into two paginate
      blocks — they would contend over the same ?page= parameter.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- paginate collections['all'].products by 250 -%}

      {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Catalogue has outgrown 250. Fail loudly rather than silently
          dropping fragrances from the picker.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if request.design_mode -%}
          <p style="background:#b3261e;color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6">
            &#9888; RAQI Discovery Box: the catalogue now holds {{ paginate.items }} products, which exceeds the 250-product
            render ceiling. Fragrances beyond the first 250 are NOT appearing in the picker below. Increase the
            <code>by 250</code> value in sections/raqi-discovery-box.liquid, or move the picker to dedicated
            tag-filtered collections.
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <script>
          console.error('RAQI Discovery Box: catalogue truncated — rendering 250 of {{ paginate.items }} products. Fragrances are missing from the picker.');
        </script>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="raqi-db__panel" data-db-panel="1">
        <h2 class="raqi-db__panel-heading">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_1_heading' | t }}</h2>
        <div class="raqi-db__grid" data-db-picker="signature">
          {%- for product in collections['all'].products -%}
            {%- if product.tags contains 'Signature' -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign v10 = null
              for variant in product.variants
                if variant.title contains '10' and v10 == null
                  assign v10 = variant
                endif
              endfor
              # 2026-09-03: an out-of-stock fragrance STAYS in this grid. It
              # used to be taken off sale by setting the product to draft,
              # which drops it out of collections['all'] and so out of this
              # loop entirely — the card simply vanished, which reads as "we
              # never carried it" rather than "not right now". Now the product
              # stays active with inventory tracked at 0 and policy deny, and
              # the card is rendered, badged and dimmed instead.
              #
              # Selection is refused in wireGrid(), not here, deliberately: the
              # card must stay in the DOM, keep its data-* attributes and keep
              # its notes button working, so a customer can still read what the
              # fragrance is before deciding to wait for it.
              assign oos = false
              unless product.available
                assign oos = true
              endunless
            -%}
            {%- if v10 -%}
              <div
                class="raqi-db__pick-card{% if oos %} is-oos{% endif %}"
                data-db-pick
                data-oos="{% if oos %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                {% if oos %}aria-disabled="true"{% endif %}
                role="button"
                tabindex="0"
                data-variant-id="{{ v10.id }}"
                data-name="{{ product.title | escape }}"
                data-vendor="{{ product.vendor | escape }}"
                data-scent-family="{{ product.metafields.raqi.scent_family | escape }}"
                data-notes-top="{{ product.metafields.raqi.notes_top | escape }}"
                data-notes-heart="{{ product.metafields.raqi.notes_heart | escape }}"
                data-notes-base="{{ product.metafields.raqi.notes_base | escape }}"
              >
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-media">
                  {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
                    {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: product.title }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                {%- if oos -%}
                  <span class="raqi-db__pick-oos">{{ 'products.product.out_of_stock' | t }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-check" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span>
                <button type="button" class="raqi-db__pick-notes-trigger" data-view-notes aria-label="{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.notes_trigger_label' | t }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                    <path d="M8 7.2v4.1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <circle cx="8" cy="4.9" r="0.8" fill="currentColor"/>
                  </svg>
                  {{ 'raqi.discovery_box.notes_trigger_label' | t }}
                </button>
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-vendor">{{ product.vendor }}</span>
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-name">{{ product.title | remove_first: product.vendor | strip }}</span>
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-volume">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.volume_label' | t }}</span>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="raqi-db__actions">
          <button type="button" class="raqi-btn raqi-btn-primary" id="RaqiDbNext1" disabled>{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.continue_label' | t }}</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="raqi-db__panel" data-db-panel="2" hidden>
        <h2 class="raqi-db__panel-heading">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_2_heading' | t }}</h2>
        <p class="raqi-db__panel-hint" id="RaqiDbStep2Hint">{{ step2_hint_0 }}</p>
        <div class="raqi-db__grid" data-db-picker="discovery">
          {%- for product in collections['all'].products -%}
            {%- if product.tags contains 'Discovery' -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign v10 = null
              for variant in product.variants
                if variant.title contains '10' and v10 == null
                  assign v10 = variant
                endif
              endfor
              # 2026-09-03: an out-of-stock fragrance STAYS in this grid. It
              # used to be taken off sale by setting the product to draft,
              # which drops it out of collections['all'] and so out of this
              # loop entirely — the card simply vanished, which reads as "we
              # never carried it" rather than "not right now". Now the product
              # stays active with inventory tracked at 0 and policy deny, and
              # the card is rendered, badged and dimmed instead.
              #
              # Selection is refused in wireGrid(), not here, deliberately: the
              # card must stay in the DOM, keep its data-* attributes and keep
              # its notes button working, so a customer can still read what the
              # fragrance is before deciding to wait for it.
              assign oos = false
              unless product.available
                assign oos = true
              endunless
            -%}
            {%- if v10 -%}
              <div
                class="raqi-db__pick-card{% if oos %} is-oos{% endif %}"
                data-db-pick
                data-oos="{% if oos %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                {% if oos %}aria-disabled="true"{% endif %}
                role="button"
                tabindex="0"
                data-variant-id="{{ v10.id }}"
                data-name="{{ product.title | escape }}"
                data-vendor="{{ product.vendor | escape }}"
                data-scent-family="{{ product.metafields.raqi.scent_family | escape }}"
                data-notes-top="{{ product.metafields.raqi.notes_top | escape }}"
                data-notes-heart="{{ product.metafields.raqi.notes_heart | escape }}"
                data-notes-base="{{ product.metafields.raqi.notes_base | escape }}"
              >
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-media">
                  {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
                    {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: product.title }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                {%- if oos -%}
                  <span class="raqi-db__pick-oos">{{ 'products.product.out_of_stock' | t }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-check" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span>
                <button type="button" class="raqi-db__pick-notes-trigger" data-view-notes aria-label="{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.notes_trigger_label' | t }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="13" height="13" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                    <path d="M8 7.2v4.1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <circle cx="8" cy="4.9" r="0.8" fill="currentColor"/>
                  </svg>
                  {{ 'raqi.discovery_box.notes_trigger_label' | t }}
                </button>
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-vendor">{{ product.vendor }}</span>
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-name">{{ product.title | remove_first: product.vendor | strip }}</span>
                <span class="raqi-db__pick-volume">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.volume_label' | t }}</span>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="raqi-db__actions">
          <button type="button" class="raqi-btn raqi-btn-secondary" id="RaqiDbBack2">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.back_label' | t }}</button>
          <button type="button" class="raqi-btn raqi-btn-primary" id="RaqiDbNext2" disabled>{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.continue_label' | t }}</button>
        </div>
      </div>

    {%- endpaginate -%}

    <div class="raqi-db__panel" data-db-panel="3" hidden>
      <h2 class="raqi-db__panel-heading">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_3_heading' | t }}</h2>
      <div class="raqi-db__review-list" id="RaqiDbReviewList"></div>
      <div class="raqi-db__total-row">
        <span>{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.total_label' | t }}</span>
        <span class="raqi-db__total-vals">
          {%- if box_was_display != blank -%}
            <s class="raqi-db__total-was">{{ box_was_display }}</s>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span id="RaqiDbTotal">{{ box_price_display }}</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="raqi-db__actions">
        <button type="button" class="raqi-btn raqi-btn-secondary" id="RaqiDbBack3">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.back_label' | t }}</button>
        <button type="button" class="raqi-btn raqi-btn-accent" id="RaqiDbAddToCart">{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.add_to_cart_label' | t }}</button>
      </div>
      <div class="raqi-db__message" id="RaqiDbMessage" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="raqi-db__notes-modal" id="RaqiDbNotesModal" hidden>
    <div class="raqi-db__notes-modal-backdrop" data-close-notes></div>
    <div class="raqi-db__notes-modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="RaqiDbNotesModalTitle">
      <button type="button" class="raqi-db__notes-modal-close" data-close-notes aria-label="{{ 'raqi.discovery_box.notes_close_label' | t }}">&times;</button>
      <p class="raqi-db__notes-modal-vendor" id="RaqiDbNotesModalVendor"></p>
      <h3 class="raqi-db__notes-modal-title" id="RaqiDbNotesModalTitle"></h3>
      <p class="raqi-db__notes-modal-family" id="RaqiDbNotesModalFamily"></p>
      <div class="raqi-db__notes-modal-rows" id="RaqiDbNotesModalRows"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .raqi-db{ padding:64px 0 96px; }
  .raqi-db__intro{ text-align:center;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 40px; }
  .raqi-db__heading{ font-family:var(--raqi-font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:40px;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin:16px 0 16px; }
  .raqi-db__subhead{ font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin:0; }

  .raqi-db__progress{ max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 8px; }
  .raqi-db__step-label{ text-align:center;font:500 11px/1 var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-accent);margin:0 0 14px; }
  .raqi-db__bar{ height:2px;background:var(--raqi-rule);margin-bottom:22px; }
  .raqi-db__bar-fill{ height:100%;background:var(--raqi-accent);transition:width .3s ease; }
  .raqi-db__dots{ display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:40px; }
  .raqi-db__dot{ display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:none;border:none;cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.4;flex:1; }
  .raqi-db__dot:not(:disabled){ cursor:pointer;opacity:1; }
  .raqi-db__dot-num{ width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:500 11px var(--raqi-font-body);color:var(--raqi-text-muted); }
  .raqi-db__dot.is-active .raqi-db__dot-num{ background:var(--raqi-ink);border-color:var(--raqi-ink);color:var(--raqi-bg-page); }
  .raqi-db__dot:not(:disabled):not(.is-active) .raqi-db__dot-num{ border-color:var(--raqi-accent);color:var(--raqi-accent); }
  .raqi-db__dot-label{ font:400 9.5px var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-text-muted); }

  .raqi-db__summary-bar{ display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;background:var(--raqi-bg-panel);border:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);padding:12px 20px;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 32px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--raqi-ink); }
  .raqi-db__change-link{ background:none;border:none;color:var(--raqi-accent);text-decoration:underline;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer; }

  .raqi-db__panel-heading{ text-align:center;font-family:var(--raqi-font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:24px;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin:0 0 8px; }
  .raqi-db__panel-hint{ text-align:center;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin:0 0 28px; }

  .raqi-db__grid{ display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:36px; }
  .raqi-db__pick-card{ position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;background:var(--raqi-bg-page);border:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);padding:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--raqi-font-body); }
  .raqi-db__pick-card:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--raqi-accent);outline-offset:2px; }
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-selected{ border-color:var(--raqi-ink);background:var(--raqi-bg-panel); }
  .raqi-db__pick-media{ width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;background:var(--raqi-bg-panel);display:block;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden; }
  .raqi-db__pick-media img{ width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover; }
  .raqi-db__pick-check{ position:absolute;top:8px;right:8px;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--raqi-ink);color:var(--raqi-bg-page);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px; }
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-selected .raqi-db__pick-check{ display:flex; }
  .raqi-db__pick-notes-trigger{ display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:none;border:none;padding:0;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--raqi-accent);font:400 9.5px var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer; }
  .raqi-db__pick-notes-trigger:hover{ text-decoration:underline; }
  .raqi-db__pick-vendor{ font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin-bottom:3px; }
  .raqi-db__pick-name{ font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.3; }
  .raqi-db__pick-volume{ font-size:11px;color:var(--raqi-accent); }

  /* 2026-09-03 out of stock. The badge is a SIBLING of .raqi-db__pick-media,
     not a child: the dimming below is an opacity, and opacity on a parent
     fades its children with it, so a badge nested inside the media would be
     the one element guaranteed to go unreadable. It sits as a band across the
     top of the square image — .raqi-db__pick-card is already position:relative
     and the card's 12px padding is what the inset values track.
     The selected-state tick is suppressed outright rather than merely dimmed,
     so a stale .is-selected class can never imply an out-of-stock fragrance
     was picked. */
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-oos{ cursor:not-allowed; }
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-oos .raqi-db__pick-media img{ opacity:.34;filter:grayscale(1); }
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-oos .raqi-db__pick-vendor,
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-oos .raqi-db__pick-name,
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-oos .raqi-db__pick-volume{ opacity:.45; }
  .raqi-db__pick-card.is-oos .raqi-db__pick-check{ display:none; }
  .raqi-db__pick-oos{ position:absolute;top:12px;inset-inline:12px;z-index:1;
    background:var(--raqi-ink);color:var(--raqi-bg-page);
    font:500 9px/1 var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
    text-align:center;padding:6px 4px;pointer-events:none; }

  .raqi-db__actions{ display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:14px; }

  .raqi-db__review-list{ max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px; }
  .raqi-db__review-item{ display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);padding-bottom:14px; }
  .raqi-db__review-item img{ width:56px;height:56px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--raqi-bg-panel);flex:none; }
  .raqi-db__review-item-info{ flex:1; }
  .raqi-db__review-item-vendor{ font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin:0 0 2px; }
  .raqi-db__review-item-name{ font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin:0; }
  .raqi-db__review-item-volume{ font-size:11.5px;color:var(--raqi-accent);white-space:nowrap; }
  .raqi-db__total-row{ max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:500 15px var(--raqi-font-body);color:var(--raqi-ink);padding-top:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--raqi-rule); }
  /* 2026-09-05: was/now. --raqi-ink on the page ground rather than a muted grey,
     so the struck figure stays readable instead of dissolving into the rule. */
  .raqi-db__total-vals{ display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px; }
  .raqi-db__total-was{ font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:var(--raqi-ink);opacity:.75;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:1px; }
  .raqi-db__message{ max-width:520px;margin:14px auto 0;text-align:center;font-size:13px; }
  .raqi-db__message:empty{ display:none; }
  .raqi-db__message--error{ color:#b3261e; }

  .raqi-db__notes-modal[hidden]{ display:none; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal{ position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:200;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-backdrop{ position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(34,38,31,.55); }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-panel{ position:relative;background:var(--raqi-bg-page);max-width:340px;width:calc(100% - 40px);padding:28px 24px;text-align:left; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-close{ position:absolute;top:10px;right:14px;background:none;border:none;font-size:20px;line-height:1;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);cursor:pointer; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-vendor{ font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin:0 0 4px; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-title{ font-family:var(--raqi-font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:20px;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin:0 0 10px; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-family{ font-size:12px;color:var(--raqi-accent);margin:0 0 16px; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-row{ font-size:12px;color:var(--raqi-ink);line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 4px; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-row strong{ text-transform:uppercase;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin-inline-end:6px; }
  .raqi-db__notes-modal-empty{ font-size:12px;color:var(--raqi-text-muted); }

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .raqi-db__grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); }
    .raqi-db__dot-label{ display:none; }
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){
    .raqi-db__grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .raqi-db__heading{ font-size:30px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
(function(){
  try {
    var root = document.querySelector('[data-raqi-db]');
    if (!root) return;

    var state = { step: 1, signature: null, discovery: [] };
    var maxStepReached = 1;

    var stepLabelEl = document.getElementById('RaqiDbStepLabel');
    var stepLabelTemplate = {{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_label' | t | json }};
    var barFill = document.getElementById('RaqiDbBarFill');
    var dots = root.querySelectorAll('[data-db-dot]');
    var panels = root.querySelectorAll('[data-db-panel]');
    var summaryBar = document.getElementById('RaqiDbSummaryBar');
    var summaryText = document.getElementById('RaqiDbSummaryText');
    var changeBtn = document.getElementById('RaqiDbChangeSignature');
    var volumeLabel = {{ 'raqi.discovery_box.volume_label' | t | json }};

    var sigGrid = root.querySelector('[data-db-picker="signature"]');
    var discGrid = root.querySelector('[data-db-picker="discovery"]');
    var next1 = document.getElementById('RaqiDbNext1');
    var next2 = document.getElementById('RaqiDbNext2');
    var back2 = document.getElementById('RaqiDbBack2');
    var back3 = document.getElementById('RaqiDbBack3');
    var addBtn = document.getElementById('RaqiDbAddToCart');
    var step2Hint = document.getElementById('RaqiDbStep2Hint');
    var step2HintTemplate = {{ 'raqi.discovery_box.step_2_hint' | t | json }};
    var reviewList = document.getElementById('RaqiDbReviewList');
    var msgEl = document.getElementById('RaqiDbMessage');
    var errorMessage = {{ 'raqi.discovery_box.error_message' | t | json }};

    var notesModal = document.getElementById('RaqiDbNotesModal');
    var notesVendorEl = document.getElementById('RaqiDbNotesModalVendor');
    var notesTitleEl = document.getElementById('RaqiDbNotesModalTitle');
    var notesFamilyEl = document.getElementById('RaqiDbNotesModalFamily');
    var notesRowsEl = document.getElementById('RaqiDbNotesModalRows');
    var notesTopLabel = {{ 'raqi.product.note_top' | t | json }};
    var notesHeartLabel = {{ 'raqi.product.note_heart' | t | json }};
    var notesBaseLabel = {{ 'raqi.product.note_base' | t | json }};

    function cardData(card){
      return {
        id: card.getAttribute('data-variant-id'),
        name: card.getAttribute('data-name'),
        vendor: card.getAttribute('data-vendor'),
        img: card.querySelector('img') ? card.querySelector('img').src : ''
      };
    }

    function displayName(item){
      return item.name.replace(item.vendor, '').trim();
    }

    function openNotes(card){
      var vendor = card.getAttribute('data-vendor') || '';
      var name = (card.getAttribute('data-name') || '').replace(vendor, '').trim();
      var family = card.getAttribute('data-scent-family') || '';
      var top = card.getAttribute('data-notes-top') || '';
      var heart = card.getAttribute('data-notes-heart') || '';
      var base = card.getAttribute('data-notes-base') || '';

      notesVendorEl.textContent = vendor;
      notesTitleEl.textContent = name;
      notesFamilyEl.textContent = family;
      notesFamilyEl.hidden = !family;

      notesRowsEl.innerHTML = '';
      var rows = [
        [notesTopLabel, top],
        [notesHeartLabel, heart],
        [notesBaseLabel, base]
      ].filter(function(r){ return r[1]; });

      rows.forEach(function(r){
        var p = document.createElement('p');
        p.className = 'raqi-db__notes-modal-row';
        var strong = document.createElement('strong');
        strong.textContent = r[0];
        p.appendChild(strong);
        p.appendChild(document.createTextNode(r[1]));
        notesRowsEl.appendChild(p);
      });

      notesModal.hidden = false;
    }

    function closeNotes(){ notesModal.hidden = true; }

    notesModal.querySelectorAll('[data-close-notes]').forEach(function(el){
      el.addEventListener('click', closeNotes);
    });
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){
      if (e.key === 'Escape' && !notesModal.hidden) closeNotes();
    });

    function goToStep(n){
      state.step = n;
      if (n > maxStepReached) maxStepReached = n;
      stepLabelEl.textContent = stepLabelTemplate.replace('{n}', n);
      barFill.style.width = (n === 1 ? 33 : n === 2 ? 66 : 100) + '%';
      panels.forEach(function(p){ p.hidden = p.getAttribute('data-db-panel') != n; });
      dots.forEach(function(d){
        var dn = parseInt(d.getAttribute('data-db-dot'), 10);
        d.classList.toggle('is-active', dn === n);
        d.disabled = dn > maxStepReached;
      });
      summaryBar.hidden = n === 1;
      if (n !== 1 && state.signature) {
        summaryText.textContent = state.signature.vendor + ' ' + displayName(state.signature) + ' — ' + volumeLabel;
      }
      if (n === 3) renderReview();
      root.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
    }

    // 2026-09-03: one place decides whether a card can be picked, so click and
    // keyboard cannot drift apart. Checked here rather than in the two onPick
    // callbacks because this is also the only path that must NOT be blocked
    // for the notes button — reading the notes on an out-of-stock fragrance is
    // still useful, so that branch returns before the guard.
    function isPickable(card){
      return !!card && card.getAttribute('data-oos') !== 'true';
    }

    function wireGrid(grid, onPick){
      if (!grid) return;
      grid.addEventListener('click', function(e){
        var notesBtn = e.target.closest('[data-view-notes]');
        if (notesBtn) {
          e.stopPropagation();
          openNotes(notesBtn.closest('[data-db-pick]'));
          return;
        }
        var card = e.target.closest('[data-db-pick]');
        if (!isPickable(card)) return;
        onPick(card);
      });
      grid.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){
        if (e.key !== 'Enter' && e.key !== ' ') return;
        var card = e.target.closest('[data-db-pick]');
        if (!isPickable(card)) return;
        e.preventDefault();
        onPick(card);
      });
    }

    wireGrid(sigGrid, function(card){
      sigGrid.querySelectorAll('.is-selected').forEach(function(c){ c.classList.remove('is-selected'); });
      card.classList.add('is-selected');
      state.signature = cardData(card);
      next1.disabled = false;
    });
    if (next1) next1.addEventListener('click', function(){ if (state.signature) goToStep(2); });

    wireGrid(discGrid, function(card){
      var id = card.getAttribute('data-variant-id');
      var idx = state.discovery.findIndex(function(d){ return d.id === id; });
      if (idx > -1) {
        state.discovery.splice(idx, 1);
        card.classList.remove('is-selected');
      } else {
        if (state.discovery.length >= 2) return;
        state.discovery.push(cardData(card));
        card.classList.add('is-selected');
      }
      step2Hint.textContent = step2HintTemplate.replace('{count}', state.discovery.length);
      next2.disabled = state.discovery.length !== 2;
    });
    if (back2) back2.addEventListener('click', function(){ goToStep(1); });
    if (next2) next2.addEventListener('click', function(){ if (state.discovery.length === 2) goToStep(3); });
    if (back3) back3.addEventListener('click', function(){ goToStep(2); });

    if (changeBtn) {
      changeBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ goToStep(1); });
    }

    function renderReview(){
      var items = [state.signature].concat(state.discovery).filter(Boolean);
      reviewList.innerHTML = '';
      items.forEach(function(item){
        var row = document.createElement('div');
        row.className = 'raqi-db__review-item';
        row.innerHTML = '<img src="' + item.img + '" alt="">' +
          '<div class="raqi-db__review-item-info">' +
            '<p class="raqi-db__review-item-vendor">' + item.vendor + '</p>' +
            '<p class="raqi-db__review-item-name">' + displayName(item) + '</p>' +
          '</div>' +
          '<span class="raqi-db__review-item-volume">' + volumeLabel + '</span>';
        reviewList.appendChild(row);
      });
    }

    if (addBtn) {
      addBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        var boxVariantId = root.getAttribute('data-box-variant-id');
        var items = [state.signature].concat(state.discovery).filter(Boolean);
        if (items.length !== 3 || !boxVariantId) {
          msgEl.textContent = boxVariantId ? '' : errorMessage;
          if (!boxVariantId) msgEl.classList.add('raqi-db__message--error');
          return;
        }
        var properties = {};
        properties['Signature Fragrance'] = items[0].vendor + ' ' + displayName(items[0]);
        properties['Discovery Fragrance 1'] = items[1].vendor + ' ' + displayName(items[1]);
        properties['Discovery Fragrance 2'] = items[2].vendor + ' ' + displayName(items[2]);

        addBtn.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
        msgEl.textContent = '';
        fetch('/cart/add.js', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', Accept: 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: boxVariantId, quantity: 1, properties: properties }] })
        })
          .then(function(r){ return r.json().catch(function(){ return {}; }).then(function(d){ return { ok: r.ok, data: d }; }); })
          .then(function(result){
            if (result.ok) {
              try { document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh', { detail: { open: true } })); }
              catch (e) { window.location.href = '/cart'; }
            } else {
              msgEl.textContent = errorMessage;
              msgEl.classList.add('raqi-db__message--error');
            }
          })
          .catch(function(){
            msgEl.textContent = errorMessage;
            msgEl.classList.add('raqi-db__message--error');
          })
          .finally(function(){ addBtn.removeAttribute('aria-busy'); });
      });
    }

    goToStep(1);
  } catch (e) { /* never let this break the page */ }
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Raqi: Discovery Box",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "box_price", "label": "Fixed box price fallback", "info": "Only used if the box product below can't be found. Normally the price is read live from that product's variant.", "default": "Dhs. 599.00" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "box_product_handle", "label": "Box bundle product handle", "default": "raqi-discovery-box", "info": "Must match a real product's handle. Its first variant is added to cart at quantity 1." }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
